{"id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-partial-recursive-function-class.md","title":"Partial Recursive Function Class","display":"df-partial-recursive-function-class — Partial Recursive Function Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class","aliases":["68-df-partial-recursive-function-class"],"display":"df-partial-recursive-function-class — Partial Recursive Function Class","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","[[68-df-basic-functions]]","[[68-df-composition-closure]]","[[68-df-primitive-recursion-closure]]","[[68-df-mu-operator-closure]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§5.5 p.10 and §8.3 p.23 / PDF 19,32","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-partial-recursive-function-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-recursive-function-class — Partial Recursive Function Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"730162c45cd0b387\" href=\"?note=730162c45cd0b387\" title=\"68-df-basic-functions\">68-df-basic-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a090dc1ec2052307\" href=\"?note=a090dc1ec2052307\" title=\"68-df-composition-closure\">68-df-composition-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"54207c2b1fc6db5d\" href=\"?note=54207c2b1fc6db5d\" title=\"68-df-primitive-recursion-closure\">68-df-primitive-recursion-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9683212a4006caa3\" href=\"?note=9683212a4006caa3\" title=\"68-df-mu-operator-closure\">68-df-mu-operator-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.5 p.10 and §8.3 p.23 / PDF 19,32"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasicFunc}\">\\(\\mathrm{BasicFunc}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}\\)</span> 分别见所列直接依赖，均作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 为下式引入的函数集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}:=\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\mathrm{BasicFunc}\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}(F)=F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}(F)=F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}(F)=F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PartRec}:=\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\mathrm{BasicFunc}\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}(F)=F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}(F)=F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}(F)=F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §§5、8.3，印刷 pp.10,23 / PDF pp.19,32。\\mathcal F 给出集合大小的明确环境，避免把交集写成未绑定的任意类量化；\\mathcal F 本身封闭，所以被交族非空。与原书从机器定义 recursive 的等价关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d018b8faa50481e8\" href=\"?note=d018b8faa50481e8\" title=\"68-thm-basic-machine-characterization\">68-thm-basic-machine-characterization</a>，不把等价性当作未经证明的定义条款。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-functions","status":"resolved","id":"730162c45cd0b387","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-composition-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a090dc1ec2052307","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-composition-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-primitive-recursion-closure","status":"resolved","id":"54207c2b1fc6db5d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-primitive-recursion-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-mu-operator-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9683212a4006caa3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-mu-operator-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$\\mathrm{BasicFunc}$、$\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}$、$\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}$、$\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}$ 分别见所列直接依赖，均作用于 $\\mathcal F$ 的子集。$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 为下式引入的函数集合。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-basic-machine-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"d018b8faa50481e8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应 §§5、8.3，印刷 pp.10,23 / PDF pp.19,32。\\mathcal F 给出集合大小的明确环境，避免把交集写成未绑定的任意类量化；\\mathcal F 本身封闭，所以被交族非空。与原书从机器定义 recursive 的等价关系见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]，不把等价性当作未经证明的定义条款。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasicFunc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}:=\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\mathrm{BasicFunc}\\subseteq F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}(F)=F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{primrec}}(F)=F\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mu}(F)=F\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1631,"backlinks":[{"id":"f25b8a41e54b05e7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 是 [[68-df-turing-computable-function]] 的本地图灵机偏函数类，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 是 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]] 的闭包定义函数类。两类使用的机器、运行和输入输出规则均为第 68 本的本地定义；本条直接采用 [[68-thm-turing-recursive-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathcal F_k$、$\\mathbb N^k$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 专指全的递归函数。"},{"id":"d018b8faa50481e8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BMRec}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。"},{"id":"b4e5ac811eb1d921","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"偏函数图、有限元组连接及 $\\simeq$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]；$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}$、$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 分别见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]、[[68-df-recursive-function]]。使用 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]] 和 [[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 的本地编号。$m=0$ 或 $k=0$ 时相应输入元组为 $()$。"},{"id":"2ae8d5f86d63b8a4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$，$R\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}$；见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathcal F_k$ 与有限元组连接见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。"},{"id":"c4d2f7264607dcc1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$G\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap\\mathcal F_{k+1}$，输入为 $\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle$，连接算子见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。函数类与索引见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]、[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]；$\\simeq$ 是偏值相等。"},{"id":"fd495d9c69fc281b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 是 [[68-df-turing-computable-function]] 的本地图灵机偏函数类，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]。图灵机的机器集合、输入编码、配置演化和输出规则全部取 [[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] 的固定定义。基本机器与偏递归函数类的对应见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"闭包与不动点：[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]、[[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]、[[68-thm-universal-function-theorem]]、[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]、[[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]]、[[68-thm-recursion-theorem-with-parameters]]。"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2","730162c45cd0b387","a090dc1ec2052307","54207c2b1fc6db5d","9683212a4006caa3","d018b8faa50481e8"]}